('127.105.d.6.B',4,'A beginning design for a bus shelter must consider users, weather, and:','["Mood only", "Speed only", "Function", "Wallpaper"]'::jsonb,2,'Function drives practical design.','original'),
('127.105.d.6.C',3,'Architectural media include pencil, ink, and:','["Wood only", "Pasta", "Cotton", "Digital drawing software"]'::jsonb,3,'Media are drawing methods.','original'),
('127.105.d.6.C',4,'A beginner learning to use tools well in a design shows effective use of:','["Media and tools", "Luck", "Noise", "Weather"]'::jsonb,0,'Skill with media.','original'),
('127.105.d.7.A',3,'Comparing historic and modern buildings can reveal differences in:','["Taxes only", "Materials and style", "Parking only", "Addresses"]'::jsonb,1,'Comparison shows change.','original'),
('127.105.d.7.A',4,'Which style is known for pointed arches and flying buttresses?','["Brutalist", "Modern", "Gothic", "Art deco"]'::jsonb,2,'Gothic features these elements.','original'),
