('127.105.d.7.B',4,'Contemporary architecture often uses glass, steel, and:','["Sustainable materials", "Mud only", "Papyrus", "Thatch only"]'::jsonb,0,'Modern materials vary.','original'),
('127.105.d.7.C',3,'Career opportunities in architecture include architect and:','["Pilot", "Drafter", "Dentist", "Chef"]'::jsonb,1,'Related careers exist.','original'),
('127.105.d.7.C',4,'An architect differs from a drafter mainly in that an architect:','["Only measures", "Only prints", "Is licensed to design and take responsibility", "Never draws"]'::jsonb,2,'Architects require a license.','original'),
('127.105.d.8.A',3,'Justifying a design decision means:','["Avoiding review", "Skipping reasons", "Hiding the choice", "Explaining why a choice was made"]'::jsonb,3,'Justify with reasons.','original'),
('127.105.d.8.A',4,'A student explains that a deep overhang was chosen to shade windows. This shows:','["Evaluating and justifying a design choice", "Avoiding critique", "Hiding cost", "Guessing"]'::jsonb,0,'Reasons support decisions.','original'),
('127.105.d.8.B',3,'A portfolio of original architectural work is used to:','["Replace school", "Show skills to others", "Hide skills", "Lose work"]'::jsonb,1,'Portfolios show ability.','original'),
('127.105.d.8.B',4,'Selecting the best projects for a portfolio means choosing work that shows:','["Only the first drafts", "Blank pages", "Range and quality", "Random scraps"]'::jsonb,2,'Select strong work.','original'),
('127.105.d.9.A',3,'Employment and entrepreneurial opportunities in architecture include working for a firm or:','["Avoiding work", "Closing all studios", "Avoiding clients", "Starting your own studio"]'::jsonb,3,'Entrepreneurs start firms.','original'),
('127.105.d.9.A',4,'Preparation for an architecture career often includes a degree and:','["Licensing exams", "A movie pass", "A fishing trip", "A cooking class"]'::jsonb,0,'Licensure is required.','original'),
