('127.105.d.9.B',4,'A long-term goal in architecture might be to:','["Finish a sketch", "Plot a sheet", "Become a licensed architect", "Join a club"]'::jsonb,2,'Long-term goals take years.','original'),
('127.105.d.9.C',3,'Technology used in architectural careers includes CAD and:','["Slide rules only", "Typewriters", "Chalk", "BIM software"]'::jsonb,3,'Technology supports design.','original'),
('127.105.d.9.C',4,'Drones are used by architects to:','["Survey sites and capture images", "Pour concrete", "Wire panels", "Frame walls"]'::jsonb,0,'Drones assist site documentation.','original'),
